.frizz/
# Transitional: a checkout that has not been opened by Frizz yet still has its pre-rebrand `.fray/`
# (hundreds of thread scratchpads). Un-ignoring it would let the next `git add -A` commit the lot.
# Delete this line with migrate-fray.ts.
.fray/

